Prepare and list build-guest base images (VM drivers)

Usage:
  warden image [command]

Available Commands:
  list        List prepared build-guest base images for every driver
  prepare     Acquire, verify and ready a build-guest base image
  verify      Re-hash cached base-image layers and report drift

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for image

Global Flags:
      --color string     color output (auto, always, never)
      --config string    config file to read, the only one that is (default: WARDEN_CONFIG, then ./warden.toml if it exists)
      --driver string    orchestration driver (container, qemu, vz, hyperv, firecracker)
      --runtime string   container runtime (finch, docker, podman)
  -v, --verbose          verbose output

Use "warden image [command] --help" for more information about a command.
